    "show_share": true,
    "description": "\"The Health Action Schools (HAS) team of the Aga Khan University Institute for Educational Development (AKU-IED) conducted a three-day workshop for teachers on health promotion in schools. The workshop led by Dr Tashmin Khamis, Assistant Professor, AKU-IED, in partnership with Save the Children Fund and facilitated by Mr Hugh Hawes, founder of the Child-to-Child Trust, held its final session on Friday, February 12. Over thirty teachers from government and private schools attended the workshop.",
